  "title": "India bloc to hold public impeachment of CEC Gyanesh Kumar and Dilli Chalo March",
  "summary": "The India bloc plans to hold a public impeachment proceeding of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar on October 30, followed by a Dilli Chalo March against 'Vote Chor' culminating at Ramleela Maidan on November 1st, as leaders seek to challenge the CEC and restore electoral integrity.",
