    {
      "title": "INDIA bloc to hold 'public impeachment' of CEC Gyanesh Kumar on Oct 30",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/india-bloc-to-hold-public-impeachment-of-cec-gyanesh-kumar-on-oct-30-126102401134_1.html",
      "description": "Leaders of the opposition INDIA Bloc will hold a \"public impeachment\" of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar on October 30 and announce a public verdict against him.\nThe \"mock Parliament\" would be held at Hotel Ashok, where all opposition MPs and top leaders would be present, it is learnt.\nCongress general secretary, organisation, K C Venugopal said the next day, on November 1, the bloc will carry out a 'Dilli Chalo march' to Ramlila Maidan, which it touted as its \"biggest\", against \"vote chori\".\n\"In our effort to save the Constitution and defeat the Vote Chors, INDIA bloc will be holding a crucial Public Impeachment proceeding on 30th October - where the public's verdict to remove the 'Vote Chor' CEC Gyanesh Kumar will be delivered loud and clear,\" Venugopal said on X.\n\"After this Public Impeachment, we will hold a 'Dilli Chalo March' against 'Vote Chori' culminating at Ramleela Maidan on November 1st, where at least a million concerned citizens will participate,\" he ...",
